<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SAfrica money market shortage up to 6.427 bln rand.</title>
<headline>SAfrica money market shortage up to 6.427 bln rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's money market shortage inched up to 6.427 billion rand on Saturday from 6.408 billion rand on Friday and 6.472 billion rand on Thursday, the Reserve Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
